theme_override_font_sizes/font_size = 60
text = "Simon Puzzle:
When you start the puzzle, a random sequence of numbers will flash, the amount of which
increases each time you progress. To complete the puzzle, you need to complete (X) rounds.
Each round, the sequence of numbers will change. You need to click the buttons in order that 
they flash, and if you make a mistake, you will be notified of your loss at the end of the round."
